WEBVTT

00:00:00.688 --> 00:00:01.378
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.304 --> 00:00:04.659
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m going to London from Wednesday to Friday.

00:00:06.558 --> 00:00:07.296
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.517
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m having dinner with Mark Taylor.

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:13.179
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:14.161 --> 00:00:16.426
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m giving my talk at two o’clock.

00:00:18.372 --> 00:00:19.174
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:22.131
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Are you doing anything on Saturday?

00:00:24.101 --> 00:00:24.953
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:25.956 --> 00:00:27.569
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We’re getting married on Saturday.